Create ingress controller 

1) Install the nginx ingress controller using  :
https://github.com/kubernetes/ingress-NGINX

Command :
kubectl apply -f https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/ingress-nginx/controller-v1.11.1/deploy/static/provider/aws/deploy.yaml

Asking the ingress controller to create a load balancer so that when the user accessing the LB using domain/hosts , forward request to the service (automatically to even the pods)

2) Check the controller 

kubectl get pods -n ingress-nginx

Watches for resources with ingress class name as nginx

